  "text": "Granted by Demon Form\n\nYou transform into a demon battle form. While in this form, you gain the demon and fiend traits. You have hands in this battle form and can use manipulate actions. You gain the following statistics and abilities regardless of the form that you choose:\n- AC = 20 + your level. Ignore your armor check's penalty and Speed reduction.\n\n- 30 temporary Hit Points, weakness 5 to cold iron, and weakness 5 to holy.\n\n- Darkvision.\n\n- One or more attacks specific to the battle form you use, which are the only attacks you can Strike with. You're trained with them. Your attack modifier is +22, and your damage bonus is +12. These attacks are Strength based (for the purpose of the enfeebled condition, for example). If your attack modifier is higher for the given unarmed attack or weapon, you can use it instead.\n\n- Athletics modifier of +23, unless your own modifier is higher.\n\nYou also gain specific abilities based on the type of demon you choose:\n- Abrikandilu Medium, Speed 25 feet\n- Melee 1 jaws (magical, unarmed, unholy), Damage 2d6 piercing, and Clumsy 1 for 1 minute on a critical hit\n\n- Melee 1 claw (agile, magical, unarmed, unholy), Damage 2d6 slashing\n\n- Ranged 1 hurled debris (range increment 20 feet, unholy), Damage 2d6 bludgeoning.\n\n- Brimorak Medium, Speed 30 feet\n- Melee 1 flaming sword (magical, unholy), Damage 2d8 slashing plus 1d6 fire\n\n- Melee 1 hoof (agile, unarmed, unholy), Damage 2d4 bludgeoning plus 1d6 fire.\n\n- Kithangian Large, Speed 30 feet\n- Melee 1 pincer (magical, reach 10 feet, unarmed, unholy), Damage 1d12 slashing, and after a successful Strike you can spend an action to attempt to Grab (Monster Core 359) the target\n\n- Melee 1 stinger (agile, magical, reach 10 feet, unarmed, unholy), Damage 1d8 piercing; all melee Strikes deal an additional 2d6 precision damage to animals.\n\n- Vloriak Medium, Speed 25 feet; resistance 10 to acid\n- Melee 1 claw (unarmed, unholy), Damage 2d6 piercing plus 1d6 spirit\n\n- Melee 1 tongue (agile, reach 10 feet, unarmed, unholy), Damage 1d6 acid plus 1d6 spirit.",
